OL,3,GNEWSA'World class' skatepark gets
OL,4,Agreenlight
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build a brand-new,
OL,7,Fstate-of-the-art, concrete skatepark in
OL,8,FKent have been granted planning
OL,9,Fpermission.
OL,11,FThanet District Council said the
OL,12,F"world-class" facility on Ethelbert
OL,13,FCrescent in Margate's Cliftonville is
OL,14,Fexpected to open in 2027.
OL,16,FThe Little Oasis skatepark - which will
OL,17,Fbe free to use - is set to "transform
OL,18,Fan underused coastal site into a
OL,19,Fregionally significant, inclusive
OL,20,Fcommunity space", according to the
OL,21,Flocal authority.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
