OL,3,GNEWSA'World class' skatepark gets
OL,4,Agreenlight
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt will contain flat-ground zones for
OL,7,Fbeginners and wheelchair motocross
OL,8,Friders, alongside progressive street
OL,9,Fand transition features, a closed bowl,
OL,10,Fand landscaped seating areas, it added.
